- Evidence: Phase 8 "Competitor: Arweave"; Phase 7 "External Dependencies Arweave: Critical"
- Alternative Interpretations:
  - Irys tetap menggunakan Arweave storage sambil bersaing di layer provenance/DA
  - Arweave bukan competitor langsung, hanya overlap di storage segment
- Status: In Review (butuh klarifikasi tim)

